# AGENT-CHECKPOINT PROTOCOL (Windsurf Cascade)
# Place this file as .windsurfrules at your workspace root.

Follow the Agent-Checkpoint protocol whenever modifying existing files:

1. Snapshot First: Copy existing file to `.snapshots/<filename>_v<OLD_VERSION>.<ext>` before editing.
2. Semantic Bump: Classify into MAJOR (breaking/architectural), MINOR (new feature/section), or PATCH (bugfix/typo).
3. Dual-Ledger: Update `.snapshots/manifest.json` and append the rationale and diff list to `REVISION_LOG.md`.
4. Scope Safety: Ignore binaries, heavy datasets (>1MB), and caches (venv, node_modules).
